# JEE Edge runs entirely in the browser. No server environment variables are required.
#
# The optional Gemini assistant uses keys entered in the app's Settings screen.
# Those keys are stored in this browser's localStorage and sent directly to
# Google's Gemini API. Do NOT put real keys in a Vite variable: every VITE_*
# value is embedded in the public JavaScript bundle.
#
# If you later add a local proxy server, keep its key here (never VITE_*):
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
